  "command": "CHROMIUM_PATH='/app/.toolchains/playwright/chromium-1234/chrome-linux64/chrome' LEAN_BRIDGE_COMPOSER='/usr/bin/composer' LEAN_BRIDGE_LEAN_PREFIX='/app/.toolchains/elan/toolchains/leanprover--lean4---v4.32.2' LEAN_BRIDGE_NOMINAL_SUBTYPE_PHP_WASM_MODES='full' LEAN_BRIDGE_NOMINAL_SUBTYPE_PHP_WASM_OUTPUT='/app/build/vo1457-php-wasm-installed-ordinary-full-r1-d121427/records' LEAN_BRIDGE_NOMINAL_SUBTYPE_PHP_WASM_ROUTES='ordinary' LEAN_BRIDGE_NOMINAL_SUBTYPE_PHP_WASM_TEST='1' LEAN_BRIDGE_PHP='/usr/bin/php' LEAN_BRIDGE_PHP_EMSDK='/app/.toolchains/emsdk-php-wasm' LEAN_BRIDGE_PHP_SOURCE='/app/build/php-wasm-sdk/php8.4-src' LEAN_BRIDGE_PHP_WASM_HOST='/app/build/php-wasm-host/node_modules/php-wasm' LEAN_BRIDGE_TEST_PHP_COPIED_RUNTIME='/app/build/type-corpus/php-wasm-current-runtime' LEAN_NUM_THREADS='1' MAKEFLAGS='-j1' NO_COLOR='1' OMP_NUM_THREADS='1' PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSERS_PATH='/app/.toolchains/playwright' '/usr/bin/nice' '-n' '19' '/usr/bin/ionice' '-c' '3' '/usr/bin/taskset' '-c' '3' '/usr/bin/node' '--max-old-space-size=3072' '--test' '--test-concurrency=1' '--test-reporter=tap' 'tests/helpers/nominal-subtype-php-wasm-installed-tests.mjs'",
  "scope": "Two independent author builds reproduce the API, component and shared-runtime archives. Offline installation follows author-root removal. All twelve Node/Chromium, installation, loading and strictness contexts pass twice after relocation. Package checks authenticate every archive member, installed file and loaded wasm32 runtime. The full API checks per-use constructor selection and normalization, repeated record fields, active variant branches, aliases, mixed Fin guards, rejection paths, unchanged caller inputs and recovery. Nominal PHP-Wasm acceptance covers the tested Nat records, variants, aliases, nested copied containers and constructor-free results on wasm32 PHP 8.4.1, Node 22.23.2 and Chromium 151.0.7922.34 on Linux x64. Each selection checks twelve contexts: Node embedded and Composer installations and Chromium bundles, each with startup/lazy loading and weak/strict callers, executed twice after installation-tree relocation. Two independent author roots reproduce all three archives and are removed before offline installation. Complete API, component and shared-runtime archives, original caller and compiler records, launcher, runtime identity and test output are retained; external toolchains and browser binaries are not. The local compiler ran through the recorded Nix command transport adapter, not a Nix sandbox. Other primitive-base nominal fixtures, refined callbacks, owned, recursive, dependent and broader generic Subtypes remain separate work. Entry counts and memory are unmeasured. These local results do not claim hosted acceptance of a later revision. Historical absolute command paths document the original machine and are not CI prerequisites.",
